### Create Inbound Route
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-routes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "didNumber": "+998712000000",
  "aiAgentId": 1,
  "language": "uz",
  "businessHoursStart": "09:00:00",
  "businessHoursEnd": "18:00:00",
  "fallbackMessage": "Ish vaqti tugagan. Ertaga qo'ng'iroq qiling."
}

### List Inbound Routes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-routes/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### Get Inbound Route
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-routes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Inbound Route
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-routes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "didNumber": "+998712000000",
  "aiAgentId": 1,
  "language": "uz",
  "businessHoursStart": "09:00:00",
  "businessHoursEnd": "19:00:00",
  "fallbackMessage": "Ish vaqti tugagan.",
  "enabled": true
}

### Disable (Soft-delete) Inbound Route
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-routes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get Inbound Route Stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inbound-routes/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
